WEBVTT

01:41.470 --> 01:45.990
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.630 --> 01:48.930
[Episode 35]

01:51.479 --> 01:52.280
-Master.
-Master.

01:56.200 --> 01:56.759
Divine Tree!

01:59.180 --> 01:59.900
One wisp of qi.

02:02.590 --> 02:03.590
To break the galaxy!

02:03.760 --> 02:05.040
One wisp of qi to break the galaxy?

02:16.190 --> 02:16.870
I don't believe it.

02:18.360 --> 02:19.079
Why?

02:19.630 --> 02:20.840
Why are you willing to do everything for her,

02:20.870 --> 02:21.680
regardless of the consequences?

02:21.910 --> 02:22.910
Why?

02:28.150 --> 02:29.030
If only back then,

02:31.190 --> 02:33.150
I could have met someone like this too.

02:43.390 --> 02:44.800
I hate it so much!

02:50.680 --> 02:52.400
Rong Yao's spiritual energy is exhausted.

02:52.630 --> 02:53.470
She's about to dissipate.

02:53.680 --> 02:55.000
But why did she suddenly flee?

02:56.150 --> 02:57.150
Where else does she want to go?

03:14.280 --> 03:15.000
Rong Yao?

03:15.020 --> 03:16.020
It's you,

03:16.400 --> 03:17.190
Dun Tian.

03:17.470 --> 03:18.960
It really is you.

03:21.150 --> 03:22.690
You shouldn't look like this.

03:23.280 --> 03:24.630
It's been hundreds of years.

03:25.310 --> 03:26.800
it's been hundreds of years!

03:27.560 --> 03:28.400
Have you ever thought about

03:28.430 --> 03:30.190
what I should have looked like?

03:32.760 --> 03:34.090
When you abandoned me and our daughter,

03:34.120 --> 03:35.240
without any regard,

03:35.680 --> 03:36.960
did you ever think about what

03:36.960 --> 03:37.910
we would become?

03:39.190 --> 03:39.870
Dun Tian,

03:41.030 --> 03:42.590
do you have any regrets?

03:42.910 --> 03:43.520
Silence!

03:46.360 --> 03:47.480
Slaying the Mortal-Demon Lord

03:47.680 --> 03:48.910
was exactly what I should have done.

03:49.470 --> 03:50.750
It wasn't to attain ascension

03:50.800 --> 03:52.150
and prove the Way, like what you thought.

03:54.280 --> 03:55.800
I did it for justice.

03:56.280 --> 03:57.520
I did it for all living beings.

03:59.150 --> 03:59.840
At that time,

04:00.630 --> 04:01.960
I also wanted to preserve both family and justice,

04:03.630 --> 04:04.910
but I couldn't do it.

04:05.870 --> 04:06.630
But now,

04:06.910 --> 04:08.030
I can make amends for everything.

04:08.150 --> 04:09.680
I can make everything start over!

04:17.360 --> 04:19.160
Make amends for everything?

04:20.920 --> 04:21.600
What you want to make amends for

04:21.600 --> 04:22.950
is not me at all.

04:24.820 --> 04:26.330
What you can't let go of is just

04:26.360 --> 04:27.160
the happiness and joy

04:27.160 --> 04:28.560
you once had.

04:29.720 --> 04:31.950
Now you've lost them forever, that's all.

04:35.830 --> 04:37.190
You are not Rong Yao.

04:38.560 --> 04:40.600
You have no right to speak here.

04:43.870 --> 04:45.240
Get out of here!

05:07.240 --> 05:09.270
Chang'e must regret stealing the spiritual medicine,

05:10.190 --> 05:12.430
gazing at the blue sky night after night with a heavy heart.

05:19.950 --> 05:20.720
Rong Yao,

05:22.680 --> 05:23.390
I can now

05:23.390 --> 05:24.630
start everything over.

05:27.310 --> 05:28.510
Our family

05:30.190 --> 05:31.390
will surely be reunited.

05:35.830 --> 05:36.430
Shui.

05:39.830 --> 05:40.750
What did you call me?

05:43.070 --> 05:44.430
Who let you to call me that?

05:44.920 --> 05:46.000
Don't copy your sister's ways.

05:46.480 --> 05:46.830
No.

05:48.390 --> 05:50.159
I should have told you the truth earlier.

05:50.870 --> 05:51.680
Actually, I...

05:57.950 --> 05:58.680
Mu Qingge.

05:59.390 --> 06:01.120
How dare you use tricks to harm Ranran!

06:01.430 --> 06:02.160
You're asking for death.

06:03.000 --> 06:03.750
I'm not.

06:04.310 --> 06:05.510
I am Mu Ranwu.

06:07.680 --> 06:08.510
What did you say?

06:09.040 --> 06:10.240
It's just that Mu Qingge's spiritual power

06:10.270 --> 06:11.560
and Spirit Root are in my body, that's all.

06:11.720 --> 06:12.950
Don't you know

06:13.160 --> 06:14.360
who is the real Mu Qingge?

06:20.700 --> 06:22.090
Didn't you see it from

06:22.120 --> 06:23.270
the "one wisp of qi to break the galaxy" just now?

06:23.950 --> 06:25.390
In this world,

06:25.680 --> 06:26.680
who else can do such a move,

06:26.680 --> 06:27.480
other than Mu Qingge?

06:27.720 --> 06:29.120
She's been deceiving you all along.

06:35.159 --> 06:35.630
What?

06:36.190 --> 06:37.510
Have you finally figured it out?

06:37.830 --> 06:39.159
Ever since you lost your memory,

06:39.360 --> 06:41.090
she's been pretending to be me and deceiving you.

06:41.480 --> 06:43.120
She's the one you should settle scores with.

06:44.510 --> 06:45.680
Even now,

06:46.600 --> 06:47.750
you're still like this.

06:49.000 --> 06:50.040
I never thought

06:51.000 --> 06:51.600
that our

06:51.600 --> 06:53.040
sisterly bond

06:53.480 --> 06:54.870
would fail so miserably.

06:59.510 --> 07:00.600
I don't believe her words.

07:01.630 --> 07:02.510
I only want to hear from you.

07:06.510 --> 07:07.160
That’s right.

07:08.240 --> 07:09.390
I am Mu Qingge.

07:12.800 --> 07:13.390
You...

07:14.310 --> 07:15.430
How dare you deceive me!

07:17.390 --> 07:18.040
You said you wanted to make me

07:18.040 --> 07:19.160
fall in love with you again.

07:19.800 --> 07:20.480
All of this was just

07:20.510 --> 07:21.600
your tricks to achieve your goal.

07:22.600 --> 07:23.950
It's truly the one I've been longing for,

07:23.950 --> 07:24.600
Beauty Mu.

07:25.750 --> 07:26.630
In this life,

07:26.750 --> 07:27.780
or in the previous one,

07:28.420 --> 07:29.860
you've always had this little disciple

07:30.040 --> 07:31.240
wrapped around your finger.

07:34.310 --> 07:34.950
Su Yishui,

07:35.510 --> 07:36.630
after 20 years,

07:36.650 --> 07:37.770
you haven't improved at all.

07:37.870 --> 07:39.070
Isn't it thrilling

07:39.560 --> 07:40.430
to be played like a fool?

07:41.510 --> 07:42.430
It's not like that.

07:42.560 --> 07:43.360
Then what is it like?

07:44.240 --> 07:45.480
Regarding my identity,

07:45.870 --> 07:46.950
I did deceive you.

07:47.360 --> 07:48.720
But it wasn't intentional.

07:49.240 --> 07:49.950
It's because...

07:52.920 --> 07:54.390
Because you've forgotten many things.

07:55.120 --> 07:56.040
I don't know...

07:58.560 --> 07:59.630
Can't make up any more lies?

08:01.560 --> 08:02.360
Su Yishui,

08:03.040 --> 08:04.750
I know my sister the best.

08:05.000 --> 08:06.280
If she's scheming,

08:06.310 --> 08:07.680
acting humble and trying to please people,

08:07.830 --> 08:09.430
that's when she's most likable.

08:10.070 --> 08:11.040
How many people in the past

08:11.040 --> 08:12.630
have cared for her as much as you do?

08:12.870 --> 08:14.600
When she was a Master before,

08:14.750 --> 08:16.510
you respected her so obediently.

08:16.870 --> 08:18.360
Now that she's become a disciple,

08:18.870 --> 08:20.750
she's also gained all of your affection.

08:21.070 --> 08:22.870
It's truly enviable to others.

08:25.950 --> 08:27.070
Whether it's Mu Qingge

08:27.100 --> 08:28.180
or Xue Ranran,

08:28.750 --> 08:29.600
it's up to me

08:29.680 --> 08:30.750
to kill or punish her is

08:30.750 --> 08:31.430
the Wester Sect's own business.

08:32.840 --> 08:33.789
In this life,

08:33.789 --> 08:34.750
she is my disciple.

08:37.200 --> 08:38.630
How I discipline my own disciple

08:38.789 --> 08:39.600
is not for outsiders like you

08:39.600 --> 08:40.320
to watch with pleasurex

08:40.320 --> 08:41.150
from the side.

08:49.680 --> 08:50.360
Oh no,

08:50.910 --> 08:51.910
Wei Jiu must have gone to find

08:51.910 --> 08:52.870
the Gold Refining Fire.

08:53.790 --> 08:55.480
If this item falls into the hands of this demon,

08:55.670 --> 08:56.750
it will surely throw the universe into chaos.

08:56.960 --> 08:57.550
Quick, chase after him!

08:57.790 --> 08:58.980
We must stop him at all costs.

08:59.150 --> 08:59.510
Let's go.

08:59.720 --> 09:00.080
Let's go.

09:08.500 --> 09:09.690
You've deceived me for so long.

09:10.120 --> 09:10.910
Mu Qingge,

09:11.240 --> 09:12.150
you're quite capable, aren't you?

09:12.730 --> 09:13.970
Did I cheat you out of money

09:14.000 --> 09:15.030
or did I seduce you?

09:15.240 --> 09:16.150
Why do you feel so wronged?

09:16.720 --> 09:18.320
If you remove the Soul-Cleansing Charm, you'll know

09:18.440 --> 09:19.170
that you've known my true identity

09:19.200 --> 09:20.150
this entire time.

09:21.150 --> 09:21.750
As for me,

09:22.210 --> 09:23.210
I’m your Master,

09:23.240 --> 09:24.390
but you turned me into your disciple.

09:24.440 --> 09:25.120
Su Yishui,

09:25.240 --> 09:26.360
you're treacherous!

09:26.390 --> 09:26.840
I...

09:28.840 --> 09:30.150
You must have used some kind of trick.

09:30.600 --> 09:31.870
Otherwise, why would I have kept you by my side?

09:34.240 --> 09:34.790
Fine,

09:35.270 --> 09:36.600
it's all my trickery.

09:36.750 --> 09:37.600
I deceived you.

09:38.030 --> 09:38.910
When everything is over,

09:39.120 --> 09:39.670
I'll leave.

09:39.910 --> 09:40.670
We don't need to distinguish

09:40.670 --> 09:41.790
who's the Master and who's the disciple.

09:42.080 --> 09:42.790
We can just sever

09:42.790 --> 09:43.720
our relationship completely.

09:43.840 --> 09:44.390
Don't you dare!

09:46.910 --> 09:48.360
I... I mean,

09:48.870 --> 09:49.790
the grudge between us

09:50.030 --> 09:50.750
can't be resolved

09:50.750 --> 09:51.510
by simply cutting ties.

09:51.960 --> 09:52.630
At the very least…

09:53.480 --> 09:54.360
At the very least, I must

09:54.360 --> 09:54.970
imprison you on Mount Wester

09:55.000 --> 09:55.670
and cut you into pieces.

09:56.550 --> 09:57.240
Su Yishui,

09:57.750 --> 09:58.920
you are completely heartless!

09:59.880 --> 10:01.520
Even if I am Mu Qingge, so what?

10:01.870 --> 10:02.630
Didn't I raise you

10:02.630 --> 10:03.630
to be nice and clean,

10:03.720 --> 10:04.910
without lacking food or clothing?

10:08.670 --> 10:09.390
Anyway, now

10:09.390 --> 10:10.720
I'm the only one who remembers our relationship.

10:11.200 --> 10:12.480
It's really heartbreaking.

10:13.110 --> 10:14.230
Since you hate me so much,

10:14.510 --> 10:15.320
I'll ask the Alcohol Immortal

10:15.320 --> 10:16.510
to put a Soul-Cleansing Charm on me too.

10:16.790 --> 10:17.670
I'll have all the memories of you

10:17.670 --> 10:18.750
washed away completely.

10:19.360 --> 10:20.080
Then,

10:20.600 --> 10:21.510
we'll treat each other

10:21.510 --> 10:22.200
as strangers.

10:22.550 --> 10:23.240
End of story.

10:28.550 --> 10:29.360
If I had known yesterday,

10:29.360 --> 10:31.000
I wouldn't have helped this stinky girl stabilize her spiritual power,

10:31.610 --> 10:33.270
giving her so much strength to anger me.

10:34.790 --> 10:35.320
Master.

10:35.840 --> 10:36.550
Master, are you...

10:37.030 --> 10:37.960
alright?

10:38.830 --> 10:39.680
Don't call me Master.

10:42.550 --> 10:43.670
Then should I call you Shui?

10:45.320 --> 10:46.080
Or perhaps

10:46.480 --> 10:47.600
I should call you Mr. Su?

10:49.440 --> 10:50.410
Are you reminding me

10:50.440 --> 10:51.480
that I'm older than you?

10:52.960 --> 10:54.320
If I wanted to remind you of that,

10:54.600 --> 10:55.840
I wouldn't call you Mr. Su.

10:56.200 --> 10:57.320
Instead, I would directly called you

10:57.480 --> 10:58.390
Uncle Su.

10:58.910 --> 11:00.030
Uncle Su?

11:01.080 --> 11:01.510
You...

11:02.150 --> 11:02.670
You...

11:05.720 --> 11:06.870
Why did I

11:07.360 --> 11:08.320
risk my life

11:08.670 --> 11:10.030
to revive a demoness like you?

11:12.870 --> 11:13.440
Forget it.

11:13.830 --> 11:15.280
I'm tired of going in circles with you here.

11:15.840 --> 11:17.000
Let's go find the Gold Refining Fire first.

11:24.510 --> 11:25.440
Uncle Ye Xin?

11:29.720 --> 11:30.910
You look too much like my daughter.

11:33.870 --> 11:35.200
I can't bear to kill you.

11:36.390 --> 11:37.150
But it doesn't matter.

11:38.630 --> 11:39.960
All of this is temporary.

11:40.550 --> 11:41.790
After I complete my grand plan,

11:42.100 --> 11:43.370
I will definitely not mistreat you.

11:44.270 --> 11:45.030
Grand plan?

11:46.320 --> 11:47.550
What exactly do you want to do?

11:48.630 --> 11:49.550
I just

11:50.630 --> 11:52.150
want to get back my wife and daughter,

11:52.360 --> 11:53.750
and start everything over again.

11:54.470 --> 11:55.600
How can there be anything in this world

11:55.600 --> 11:56.910
that can turn back time

11:57.320 --> 11:58.720
and relive the past?

11:59.080 --> 11:59.870
Do you know

12:00.080 --> 12:01.480
about the Three Thousand Realms?

12:03.480 --> 12:04.670
Three Thousand Realms?

12:05.360 --> 12:06.630
Dun Tian once told me

12:06.840 --> 12:07.960
there are Three Thousand Realms

12:08.270 --> 12:09.200
and in each realm,

12:09.200 --> 12:10.360
there exists a different version of us.

12:11.360 --> 12:12.630
Dun Tian wants to go to a world

12:12.870 --> 12:14.360
where he didn't choose ascension,

12:14.720 --> 12:16.200
where he didn't sacrifice his wife and daughter,

12:16.390 --> 12:17.320
to start anew.

12:18.790 --> 12:19.930
The Three Thousand Realms Tower

12:19.960 --> 12:21.670
is the passage to the Three Thousand Realms.

12:22.120 --> 12:23.480
Dun Tian wants the Gold Refining Fire

12:23.840 --> 12:24.960
to emulate the Mortal-Demon Lord

12:24.980 --> 12:25.940
and activate the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

12:29.390 --> 12:29.870
No, that's not right.

12:30.440 --> 12:31.750
He doesn't want the Gold Refining Fire.

12:32.470 --> 12:33.480
After the Mortal-Demon Lord died,

12:33.770 --> 12:35.220
the Immortal Realm created the Gold Refining Fire

12:35.310 --> 12:36.470
to destroy his evil bones.

12:36.840 --> 12:37.550
The Mortal-Demon Lord back then

12:37.550 --> 12:38.630
couldn't have used this item.

12:39.420 --> 12:40.450
Dun Tian deliberately led everyone

12:40.480 --> 12:41.600
to search for the Gold Refining Fire.

12:41.670 --> 12:42.550
There must be a conspiracy.

12:42.580 --> 12:43.750
We need to hurry and tell everyone.

12:46.690 --> 12:47.450
Fortunately, the Immortal Realm's compass

12:47.480 --> 12:49.030
that draws down the Gold Refining Fire

12:49.050 --> 12:50.050
is still in the Celestial Sect.

12:50.750 --> 12:52.270
It saved me a lot of trouble.

13:16.070 --> 13:16.910
Found it.

13:23.560 --> 13:26.540
[Gold Refining Fire Hall of the Celestial Sect]

13:29.670 --> 13:30.960
I've finally obtained

13:32.870 --> 13:34.170
the Gold Refining Fire.

13:36.960 --> 13:37.600
Wei Jiu!

13:39.500 --> 13:40.660
Don't you dare make a move.

13:41.200 --> 13:42.270
That depends on

13:42.290 --> 13:43.620
whether you have what it takes.

13:44.030 --> 13:45.030
Don't harm their lives,

13:45.150 --> 13:46.270
lest it triggers the soul oath.

13:46.440 --> 13:47.120
-Yes.
-Yes.

14:06.420 --> 14:07.820
Su Yishui.

14:08.000 --> 14:08.510
Master.

14:08.720 --> 14:09.360
Master.

14:11.600 --> 14:13.080
If you want to steal the Gold Refining Fire,

14:13.500 --> 14:14.810
you'll have to ask if my Sword of Non-Attachment

14:14.840 --> 14:15.390
agrees or not.

14:36.780 --> 14:37.320
Be careful!

14:47.670 --> 14:48.480
Everyone, stop!

14:49.150 --> 14:49.870
Ranran!

14:51.000 --> 14:52.000
The remaining bones of the Mortal-Demon Lord

14:52.190 --> 14:53.410
haven't been fully refined yet.

15:01.690 --> 15:03.630
The Spirit Spring is the Mortal-Demon Lord's consciousness.

15:04.390 --> 15:05.550
Shui is the Demon's child.

15:07.140 --> 15:07.810
Could it be that

15:07.840 --> 15:09.150
Dun Tian came here because...

15:10.840 --> 15:11.480
Don't!

15:20.120 --> 15:21.320
Nobody touch the Gold Refining Fire.

15:21.610 --> 15:22.480
It's a trap.

15:39.270 --> 15:40.120
Break the barrier!

15:57.290 --> 15:58.960
How did you get the sacred Pearl

15:58.980 --> 15:59.910
of the Celestial Sect?

16:04.870 --> 16:06.030
H-How are you?

16:08.240 --> 16:09.120
Hold onto

16:11.240 --> 16:12.120
the Gold Refining Fire.

16:15.330 --> 16:16.750
You were willing to violate the soul oath,

16:16.770 --> 16:17.720
risking the backlash,

16:18.330 --> 16:18.970
just to help me

16:19.000 --> 16:20.150
obtain the Gold Refining Fire?

16:30.300 --> 16:31.530
I told you not to meddle.

16:32.470 --> 16:33.750
You think those foolish acts of yours

16:34.030 --> 16:35.970
will earn you more of my favor?

16:36.000 --> 16:36.910
One look at you,

16:37.210 --> 16:38.880
and I have to help stabilize your meridians

16:38.910 --> 16:39.720
and clean up your mess.

16:40.670 --> 16:41.760
I suppose you've done some good.

16:42.320 --> 16:43.320
What reward do you want?

16:43.840 --> 16:44.670
Request whatever you want.

16:45.270 --> 16:46.320
Even if...

16:46.450 --> 16:48.140
Even if you fantasize about me.

16:48.790 --> 16:50.630
I have fulfilled my promise.

16:51.560 --> 16:52.400
Please, My Lord,

16:53.030 --> 16:53.960
allow me to leave.

16:54.960 --> 16:55.480
You...

17:03.080 --> 17:04.030
It's still not working.

17:04.550 --> 17:05.640
Wei Jiu's power now

17:05.640 --> 17:06.750
has become so formidable.

17:07.030 --> 17:07.589
Even our combined efforts

17:07.589 --> 17:08.829
can't break through his barrier.

17:10.339 --> 17:11.180
Something's not right.

17:16.160 --> 17:16.829
Oh no.

17:17.069 --> 17:18.240
The demon bones of the Mortal-Demon Lord.

17:22.200 --> 17:23.589
Wei Jiu has trapped us here.

17:24.160 --> 17:25.829
He intends to use the demonic energy to kill us.

17:27.440 --> 17:28.510
It's Uncle Ye Xin.

17:29.240 --> 17:30.790
He's trying to eliminate me as well.

17:31.480 --> 17:32.680
While its demonic energy is still weak,

17:33.070 --> 17:34.240
let's try to seal it.

17:54.270 --> 17:55.000
Master!

18:02.590 --> 18:03.790
Demon's child!

18:12.590 --> 18:13.640
Let him go!

18:15.880 --> 18:17.160
Ranran! Ranran! Ranran!

18:18.400 --> 18:19.750
Ranran, are you alright?

18:20.190 --> 18:21.260
What's going on?

18:24.000 --> 18:25.000
Stop struggling.

18:25.590 --> 18:27.000
To carry my power

18:27.240 --> 18:29.240
is the Demon's child's fate from the start!

18:29.800 --> 18:31.750
It seems the residual demonic energy of the Mortal-Demon Lord

18:32.240 --> 18:33.850
wants to possess the mortal body of the Demon's child.

18:34.590 --> 18:35.970
Let's work together to subdue him first.

18:36.000 --> 18:36.440
Alright.

18:36.920 --> 18:37.720
Everyone, join forces!

18:47.350 --> 18:48.310
Su Yishui.

18:48.970 --> 18:50.210
How do you dare to

18:50.240 --> 18:51.350
challenge me

18:51.670 --> 18:53.370
with a spiritual sense muddled after cleansing?

18:54.350 --> 18:55.830
Do you think it will be effective?

19:46.020 --> 19:46.700
Master.

19:55.130 --> 19:57.320
[Scarlet Abyss, Celestial Sect]

20:14.590 --> 20:16.200
You've drained the waters of Scarlet Abyss,

20:16.640 --> 20:18.310
opening a passage to the netherworld here.

20:23.510 --> 20:24.240
Su Yishui!

20:24.650 --> 20:25.650
That's the Spirit Spring

20:25.680 --> 20:26.510
you sealed with your own hands.

20:34.030 --> 20:34.680
Shui,

20:34.960 --> 20:35.680
stop this at once!

20:37.920 --> 20:38.640
My spirit,

20:39.000 --> 20:39.720
return to me.

21:06.070 --> 21:07.840
All demonic creatures, heed my command.

21:08.350 --> 21:09.790
Come to the mortal world

21:10.310 --> 21:11.790
and do as you please.

21:12.890 --> 21:14.280
Play to your heart's content.

21:29.210 --> 21:30.770
How dare you interfere again and again?

21:31.400 --> 21:33.110
Now that my spirit and bones are united,

21:33.400 --> 21:34.750
inhabiting this mortal body,

21:35.150 --> 21:36.700
if you wish to eliminate me,

21:37.070 --> 21:39.110
it would mean Su Yishui's death.

21:39.960 --> 21:40.700
And you

21:41.440 --> 21:43.070
don't have the ability to kill me.

21:59.200 --> 22:00.750
I will kill you today

22:01.030 --> 22:02.310
to eliminate future troubles.

22:05.690 --> 22:06.310
Your spiritual sense

22:06.310 --> 22:07.880
hasn't been devoured by the demonic nature yet.

22:08.550 --> 22:10.320
You can still fight for control of your mortal body?

22:11.880 --> 22:12.750
Master!

22:16.440 --> 22:20.050
♫The heavens collapse but is erased with a smile♫

22:20.160 --> 22:23.970
♫Even if I have to shatter my bones to forge a weapon♫

22:23.990 --> 22:26.970
♫It's worth it in exchange for your life♫

22:26.590 --> 22:27.160
Ranran.

22:27.350 --> 22:28.310
Ranran, Ranran.

22:27.490 --> 22:36.780
♫The universe is witness of my heart and resolve♫

22:28.590 --> 22:29.160
Ranran.

22:31.000 --> 22:31.440
Come.

22:32.000 --> 22:32.510
Ranran.

22:32.550 --> 22:33.030
Quickly.

22:35.110 --> 22:35.640
Ranran.

22:36.350 --> 22:37.350
Your energy is very unstable.

22:37.510 --> 22:38.200
You're seriously injured.

22:38.920 --> 22:39.830
Master, he

22:41.030 --> 22:42.590
has truly become a demon.

22:46.880 --> 22:47.830
It turns out that the Scarlett Abyss

22:47.830 --> 22:48.830
is connected to the netherworld.

22:49.100 --> 22:49.850
So many demonic creatures

22:49.880 --> 22:50.790
have escaped.

22:51.880 --> 22:52.550
Where's the Demon's child?

22:52.960 --> 22:53.590
Ranran,

22:54.070 --> 22:55.030
what happened?

22:55.440 --> 22:57.110
He reopened the Spirit Spring's seal.

22:57.640 --> 22:58.310
So,

22:59.310 --> 23:00.790
the Spirit Spring has entered the body of the Demon's child's.

23:06.350 --> 23:07.590
Everyone, please join forces with me

23:08.000 --> 23:09.110
to borrow the power of heaven and earth

23:09.580 --> 23:10.580
to seal this opening.

23:11.310 --> 23:12.380
Don't let the demonic creatures from the netherworld

23:12.550 --> 23:13.350
run rampant in this world.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.000
This matter is of utmost importance.

23:15.240 --> 23:16.260
Let's deal with this first.

23:31.400 --> 23:32.270
Yu Chen.

23:34.680 --> 23:36.440
Has my brother sent any news?

23:37.160 --> 23:38.440
When will he come?

23:39.240 --> 23:40.160
I miss him so much.

23:41.970 --> 23:42.520
Miss Xiaoxiao,

23:42.550 --> 23:43.440
stay here and rest assured.

23:44.070 --> 23:45.400
The Guardian still has matters to attend to.

23:45.650 --> 23:46.850
I must go to assist the Guardian now.

23:48.070 --> 23:49.110
Then you should hurry and go.

23:49.790 --> 23:51.000
I'll just wait for my brother here.

24:26.590 --> 24:27.680
Su Yishui,

24:27.960 --> 24:29.720
why do you resist me?

24:31.110 --> 24:33.400
Those around you abandon you, deceive you, and hide things from you.

24:33.890 --> 24:35.070
Are you only fit to be

24:35.090 --> 24:36.430
their disposable pawn,

24:36.510 --> 24:37.880
to be manipulated by them as they please?

24:39.110 --> 24:40.440
As the Demon's child,

24:40.720 --> 24:42.440
you are born to be a sovereign,

24:42.550 --> 24:43.310
a powerful being.

24:44.350 --> 24:45.960
You should be

24:45.960 --> 24:47.480
the master of destiny in this world.

24:47.500 --> 24:48.310
Guardian, what's wrong?

24:49.750 --> 24:50.540
Don't come closer.

24:52.780 --> 24:53.550
Immortal-binding vine.

24:53.650 --> 24:54.450
I have brought all

24:54.480 --> 24:55.400
the immortal-binding vine seeds.

24:57.000 --> 24:58.000
Just plant them.

24:58.380 --> 24:59.440
Don't come any closer.

25:04.710 --> 25:05.840
I see.

25:06.560 --> 25:08.170
You want to use the demonic vine's absorbing power

25:08.200 --> 25:08.880
to drain me.

25:10.640 --> 25:11.480
Your spiritual power

25:11.590 --> 25:13.070
will also be drained.

25:14.070 --> 25:15.680
Would you rather become useless

25:16.160 --> 25:18.070
and even risk your life?

25:25.680 --> 25:26.200
You...

25:27.080 --> 25:27.880
You are now

25:27.880 --> 25:29.240
Su Yishui's only connection

25:29.640 --> 25:30.880
to his past self

25:31.270 --> 25:32.350
after the soul cleansing.

25:33.200 --> 25:34.480
The slightest blood relation

25:34.920 --> 25:36.550
and shared experiences of hardship

25:36.880 --> 25:38.550
is enough to sway his thoughts.

25:39.030 --> 25:39.510
The demon

25:39.790 --> 25:40.640
seeps into every crevice.

25:41.070 --> 25:41.960
Even the slightest fear,

25:42.480 --> 25:43.790
uncertainty,

25:44.550 --> 25:45.200
or unease

25:45.480 --> 25:46.720
in his heart

25:47.000 --> 25:48.310
will be devoured by the demon

25:48.750 --> 25:49.480
and amplified,

25:50.030 --> 25:51.200
leading him to demonization.

26:14.310 --> 26:16.160
Why waste your effort?

26:18.590 --> 26:19.030
You...

26:21.790 --> 26:22.440
Yu Chen!

26:26.160 --> 26:27.160
You're not Su Xiaoxiao.

26:27.520 --> 26:28.450
Of course I'm not the Su Xiaoxiao

26:28.480 --> 26:30.350
who had high hopes for you.

26:31.160 --> 26:33.000
I've crawled back from hell.

26:33.350 --> 26:34.680
You abandoned me.

26:35.200 --> 26:36.070
I hate you.

26:39.720 --> 26:41.480
You forgot the oath you made.

26:42.130 --> 26:42.650
You said

26:42.680 --> 26:43.830
everyone would only be able to

26:43.830 --> 26:45.070
bow at your feet.

26:47.510 --> 26:48.350
But what happened?

26:48.640 --> 26:50.110
What made you give up your oath?

26:53.750 --> 26:54.510
For what

26:55.350 --> 26:56.200
did I...

26:56.640 --> 26:58.750
Giving up everything for a woman,

26:59.160 --> 27:00.400
do you believe such nonsense?

27:01.110 --> 27:01.880
I don't.

27:04.350 --> 27:06.590
Have you forgotten how we endured

27:07.240 --> 27:08.350
all the suffering

27:08.370 --> 27:10.210
and waded through blood,

27:10.880 --> 27:12.440
covered in scars?

27:14.310 --> 27:15.270
What exactly

27:16.400 --> 27:17.310
was it for?

27:19.590 --> 27:20.480
Useless people

27:20.510 --> 27:22.270
are the ones who keep asking why.

27:22.830 --> 27:23.720
Become me.

27:23.960 --> 27:25.640
Become the supreme and ultimate,

27:26.350 --> 27:28.640
and you'll be the only answer in this world.

27:47.070 --> 27:47.880
Brother?

27:58.920 --> 28:00.880
This mortal body is finally stable.

28:04.550 --> 28:06.160
Did Dun Tian send you here?

28:08.590 --> 28:09.640
Where is he now?

28:10.860 --> 28:12.400
I have a big score

28:12.420 --> 28:13.570
to settle with him.

28:14.880 --> 28:15.880
This is all

28:16.070 --> 28:17.510
that has happened

28:17.510 --> 28:18.200
and what we've deduced.

28:19.680 --> 28:21.510
What exactly is the Three Thousand Realms Tower?

28:22.240 --> 28:24.160
The Mortal-Demon Lord has been annihilated for hundreds of years

28:24.650 --> 28:26.130
and the records about the Three Thousand Realms Tower

28:26.160 --> 28:27.110
are also very scarce.

28:27.750 --> 28:28.720
People only know

28:28.910 --> 28:29.560
that it is

28:29.590 --> 28:30.830
a demonic tower that destroys heaven and earth,

28:31.190 --> 28:32.030
but they don't know

28:33.200 --> 28:34.990
it's related to the heaven-defying technique you mentioned.

28:36.680 --> 28:37.680
This is the information

28:37.790 --> 28:39.590
I collected about the Three Thousand Realms Tower before.

28:42.930 --> 28:43.680
Actually,

28:44.030 --> 28:44.960
the universe is vast.

28:45.480 --> 28:46.960
It's not just

28:47.110 --> 28:48.350
the world we know.

28:49.200 --> 28:50.440
There are 3,000 realms in the world

28:50.790 --> 28:52.000
and in each realm, there are versions of you, me,

28:52.310 --> 28:53.270
and all living beings.

28:54.070 --> 28:54.880
So rather than saying

28:54.880 --> 28:56.110
Dun Tian wants to resurrect his wife and child,

28:56.790 --> 28:57.440
it's more accurate to say

28:57.590 --> 28:59.200
he wants to go to another world,

28:59.750 --> 29:01.400
find the point where his wife and child still exist,

29:01.830 --> 29:02.750
and start anew.

29:03.790 --> 29:04.480
So,

29:05.030 --> 29:06.830
the method to connect the Three Thousand Realms

29:07.510 --> 29:08.640
is the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

29:09.310 --> 29:10.680
This is a heaven-defying act

29:11.000 --> 29:12.240
that requires enormous energy

29:12.350 --> 29:13.310
and comes at a great cost.

29:14.240 --> 29:15.720
For Dun Tian to open the Three Thousand Realms,

29:16.200 --> 29:18.030
he must sacrifice everything in this world.

29:18.680 --> 29:19.480
That's why it's said

29:19.830 --> 29:20.790
the Three Thousand Realms Tower

29:20.920 --> 29:21.880
can destroy everything.

29:23.920 --> 29:24.750
You mean

29:25.590 --> 29:26.480
Dun Tian wants to destroy

29:26.510 --> 29:27.830
the realm we're in?

29:30.840 --> 29:31.670
Do you all

29:32.680 --> 29:33.790
believe what she says?

29:35.440 --> 29:36.240
Elder Yan,

29:36.640 --> 29:38.790
isn't Dun Tian

29:38.810 --> 29:39.730
the founder of your Eternal Sect?

29:40.240 --> 29:41.110
The great Dun Tian

29:41.640 --> 29:43.000
lived hundreds of years ago.

29:43.440 --> 29:44.680
How can I know his true nature?

29:45.070 --> 29:46.070
But Wen, Miss Xue,

29:46.550 --> 29:48.000
Sovereign Su, and I

29:48.350 --> 29:49.480
have been to the netherworld.

29:49.590 --> 29:51.070
We sealed the Spirit Spring and witnessed many things.

29:51.720 --> 29:52.590
Therefore, I no longer doubt

29:52.590 --> 29:53.640
the character of those two.

29:53.960 --> 29:55.590
You all should make your own judgment.

29:58.880 --> 30:00.400
Now is the time for the Heavenly Sects

30:00.440 --> 30:01.510
to unite.

30:02.350 --> 30:03.310
However, I'm not sure

30:03.550 --> 30:04.480
how specifically we can activate

30:04.510 --> 30:05.960
the Three Thousand Realms Tower

30:06.350 --> 30:07.590
or what we should do

30:07.750 --> 30:08.960
to stop his plan.

30:09.440 --> 30:11.200
This is a world-ending technique.

30:11.640 --> 30:13.640
The limited information you've gathered

30:13.790 --> 30:15.000
is far from complete.

30:15.700 --> 30:16.410
Dun Tian

30:16.640 --> 30:18.830
must have obtained this technique from the Immortal Realm.

30:19.350 --> 30:20.680
How can we, mere mortals,

30:21.000 --> 30:21.880
hope to contend with

30:21.900 --> 30:22.980
an ascended expert?

30:23.160 --> 30:23.880
Moreover,

30:24.000 --> 30:25.640
he has the Demon's child and demonic creatures

30:25.640 --> 30:26.480
assisting him.

30:27.880 --> 30:29.070
Why do we cultivate to become immortals?

30:29.520 --> 30:30.210
To save people,

30:30.240 --> 30:31.400
to bring peace to the world,

30:31.750 --> 30:32.750
and to achieve the spiritual heart.

30:33.400 --> 30:34.200
Now is the time

30:34.200 --> 30:35.070
for us to exert our power.

30:37.060 --> 30:38.100
Luring the Demon's child to demonization

30:38.720 --> 30:39.480
should be one of the steps

30:39.510 --> 30:41.110
in activating the Three Thousand Realms Tower,

30:41.720 --> 30:43.240
and a crucial one at that.

30:44.510 --> 30:45.680
But the Demon's child alone

30:45.790 --> 30:46.960
is certainly not enough.

30:47.240 --> 30:48.550
He must have subsequent actions planned.

30:49.880 --> 30:50.920
So I ask you all

30:51.160 --> 30:52.790
to carefully examine the archives of each sect again,

30:53.550 --> 30:54.240
and search for

30:54.550 --> 30:56.160
any remaining documents about the Three Thousand Realms Tower

30:57.110 --> 30:58.880
to figure out Dun Tian's next moves.

30:59.590 --> 31:00.480
That's all we can do.

31:01.000 --> 31:02.810
But there's a demon surge now.

31:03.200 --> 31:04.350
I'll go find Wei Jiu

31:04.540 --> 31:05.370
and request the Gold Refining Fire

31:05.400 --> 31:06.310
to resolve this matter.

31:07.400 --> 31:08.070
However,

31:08.750 --> 31:10.030
I have an unreasonable request.

31:10.880 --> 31:12.200
After the demon surge is cleared,

31:12.830 --> 31:13.640
please allow me

31:13.790 --> 31:15.310
to keep the Gold Refining Fire.

31:16.110 --> 31:16.750
You want to...

31:17.270 --> 31:18.440
My Master's spiritual sense still remains.

31:19.070 --> 31:19.960
The Gold Refining Fire

31:20.270 --> 31:21.510
might help me bring him back.

31:22.380 --> 31:23.950
Dun Tian wants to use him,

31:24.480 --> 31:25.830
but I won't let him succeed.

31:43.720 --> 31:45.160
What's going on with this lamp?

31:57.310 --> 31:58.240
Move it closer.

32:08.550 --> 32:09.680
He can't die yet.

32:09.900 --> 32:11.210
I'm here to kill you.

32:24.350 --> 32:25.030
Mortal-Demon Lord,

32:25.420 --> 32:26.350
back then,

32:26.350 --> 32:27.720
I could only suppress you

32:28.110 --> 32:29.590
by gathering all the Heavenly Sects.

32:30.110 --> 32:30.790
But now,

32:31.260 --> 32:32.630
you're barely my match.

32:33.360 --> 32:35.670
You're indeed a mere shadow of your former self,

32:36.070 --> 32:37.200
no longer what you used to be.

32:38.030 --> 32:39.030
Thanks to you.

32:39.890 --> 32:40.650
Even if

32:40.680 --> 32:41.880
you have the power to kill me now,

32:42.110 --> 32:43.750
you can't regain your former strength.

32:44.240 --> 32:45.030
So,

32:45.750 --> 32:47.590
don't you want to return to your prime?

32:48.240 --> 32:49.200
As if I'd believe you.

32:50.880 --> 32:52.350
Your presence here today

32:52.590 --> 32:54.070
is all my doing.

32:54.440 --> 32:55.310
In this world,

32:55.650 --> 32:56.690
nothing

32:56.720 --> 32:58.110
remains unchanged forever.

32:58.790 --> 33:00.440
We once had opposing stances,

33:00.920 --> 33:01.920
but who's to say

33:02.480 --> 33:04.000
we can't join forces now

33:04.270 --> 33:05.550
for a common goal?

33:08.480 --> 33:09.160
Why?

33:10.030 --> 33:10.880
Back then,

33:11.110 --> 33:12.960
you intended to open the Three Thousand Realms Tower

33:13.350 --> 33:14.750
when the netherworld was just formed,

33:15.110 --> 33:16.270
wanting to keep those demonic creatures

33:16.450 --> 33:17.370
in the mortal world.

33:17.960 --> 33:19.550
My wish, however, is much simpler.

33:20.030 --> 33:21.000
I only hope

33:21.840 --> 33:22.690
to return to the time

33:22.720 --> 33:24.200
when I first met my wife and daughter.

33:26.390 --> 33:28.260
So you also want to open the Three Thousand Realms Tower too?

33:30.840 --> 33:31.680
Interesting.

33:32.160 --> 33:33.470
Very interesting.

33:47.370 --> 33:48.040
Stop talking.

33:48.440 --> 33:49.160
Rest.

33:54.920 --> 33:56.270
Sovereign Wei, you're quite calculative,

33:56.790 --> 33:58.520
making others suffer for breaking their soul oath,

33:58.990 --> 33:59.820
while you can

33:59.850 --> 34:01.610
hold onto the Gold Refining Fire.

34:01.830 --> 34:03.240
Considering you gave Tu Jiuyuan

34:03.400 --> 34:04.980
some useful Foundation Stabilizing Pills,

34:05.400 --> 34:06.400
I won't hold it against you.

34:06.830 --> 34:08.290
Why haven't you left yet?

34:08.370 --> 34:08.969
Not in a hurry

34:09.000 --> 34:10.150
to find that

34:10.510 --> 34:11.480
demon-possessed

34:11.510 --> 34:12.510
Master of yours?

34:13.280 --> 34:14.920
We need to settle the score first.

34:15.449 --> 34:16.679
If you hadn't recklessly

34:16.710 --> 34:17.880
stolen the Gold Refining Fire,

34:18.110 --> 34:19.510
none of this would have happened.

34:22.540 --> 34:23.540
What do you want?

34:26.320 --> 34:27.320
I want

34:27.590 --> 34:28.480
the Gold Refining Fire.

34:29.120 --> 34:30.159
I also want your Celestial Sect

34:30.190 --> 34:31.030
to cooperate with the Heavenly Sects

34:31.199 --> 34:32.330
in using the power of the Gold Refining Fire

34:32.360 --> 34:33.320
to eliminate the demon surge

34:33.590 --> 34:34.710
and defeat Dun Tian together.

34:35.070 --> 34:35.800
The Gold Refining Fire

34:35.929 --> 34:37.330
was obtained at the cost

34:37.360 --> 34:38.000
of my people's lives.

34:38.400 --> 34:39.550
Why should I give it to you?

34:41.630 --> 34:42.760
I'm not negotiating with you.

34:43.280 --> 34:44.840
You don't think that in this chaos,

34:44.969 --> 34:46.080
holding onto the Gold Refining Fire

34:46.110 --> 34:46.880
and controlling a few demonic creatures

34:46.900 --> 34:48.050
will keep you safe, do you?

34:48.489 --> 34:49.929
Dun Tian luring all the Heavenly Sects

34:49.960 --> 34:50.760
to Mount Scarlet Flame this time

34:51.070 --> 34:52.360
has hurt you greatly too.

34:52.960 --> 34:53.989
What he wants to destroy

34:54.360 --> 34:55.960
is the world we live in.

34:56.510 --> 34:57.550
Sovereign Wei,

34:57.800 --> 34:59.440
are you still only concerned about your own affairs?

34:59.920 --> 35:00.360
You—

35:06.510 --> 35:07.740
Miss Xue is correct.

35:07.960 --> 35:09.630
There was indeed an external force at work

35:09.940 --> 35:11.260
when the Gold Refining Fire entered the Pearl.

35:12.000 --> 35:13.510
I'm afraid it was Dun Tian's doing.

35:15.590 --> 35:17.480
You should see the current situation clearly.

35:18.640 --> 35:19.850
Are you feeling better?

35:19.880 --> 35:21.190
You're in such a hurry to come out and teach me a lesson.

35:25.260 --> 35:26.140
The Gold Refining Fire

35:26.800 --> 35:28.110
was obtained at the risk of your life.

35:28.550 --> 35:29.800
If you're willing to give it to her,

35:30.200 --> 35:31.110
why should I stop you?

35:31.710 --> 35:32.750
Miss Xue

35:32.870 --> 35:33.870
saved my life.

35:34.630 --> 35:35.400
Moreover,

35:35.420 --> 35:36.900
what she says makes a lot of sense.

35:51.510 --> 35:52.030
Thank you.

35:53.320 --> 35:54.480
Sovereign Wei might as well check

35:54.480 --> 35:55.440
the archives of the Celestial Sect

35:55.920 --> 35:57.550
to see if there are any records of the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

35:57.840 --> 35:58.840
It might help prevent

35:58.840 --> 35:59.590
Dun Tian's next move.

36:02.920 --> 36:03.710
I'll take my leave now.

36:12.360 --> 36:13.550
Aren't you going back to rest?

36:14.590 --> 36:15.770
I should be going too.

36:19.190 --> 36:19.710
I...

36:51.920 --> 36:53.030
These are all your favorites.

36:53.880 --> 36:54.440
Come,

36:55.150 --> 36:56.280
let's sit and eat together.

36:58.280 --> 36:58.920
What's wrong?

36:59.720 --> 37:00.400
Don't you want to eat?

37:03.030 --> 37:03.710
Come.

37:12.510 --> 37:14.400
I picked all these for you.

37:14.760 --> 37:16.320
If you like them, keep them.

37:16.670 --> 37:17.840
If not, throw them away.

37:20.400 --> 37:21.630
These are enough for me.

37:26.840 --> 37:27.480
You all, leave.

37:27.670 --> 37:28.480
Yes.

37:34.040 --> 37:34.850
In the past,

37:35.590 --> 37:36.510
the Scarlet Sect Token

37:36.730 --> 37:37.890
was given to you by the former sovereign.

37:40.480 --> 37:41.110
Now,

37:41.510 --> 37:42.880
the Celestial Sect token

37:43.400 --> 37:44.400
is given to you by me.

37:47.160 --> 37:48.550
Do you know what this means?

37:50.440 --> 37:51.960
These are of no use to me anymore.

37:55.230 --> 37:55.870
Tu Jiuyuan,

37:56.510 --> 37:57.800
I'm willingly

37:57.820 --> 37:59.150
giving you half of the leadership

37:59.170 --> 38:00.260
of the Celestial Sect,

38:00.840 --> 38:02.000
but you're still not appreciative.

38:04.550 --> 38:05.550
What else do you want?

38:08.800 --> 38:09.710
If you

38:10.110 --> 38:11.550
insist that I like you,

38:12.670 --> 38:13.440
then I can also—

38:13.440 --> 38:14.800
I've already said I want to leave.

38:15.400 --> 38:17.030
You should keep your word.

38:17.550 --> 38:18.840
Don't go back on your word

38:19.070 --> 38:20.150
like a child.

38:21.150 --> 38:21.630
Hey.

38:22.590 --> 38:24.030
It's clearly you who's talking nonsense

38:24.130 --> 38:25.070
and causing me trouble.

38:25.320 --> 38:26.680
You confidently said you liked me,

38:26.700 --> 38:27.620
but it's only been a few days.

38:28.440 --> 38:29.670
I haven't digested it yet,

38:29.890 --> 38:30.770
and here you are,

38:31.490 --> 38:32.530
suddenly acting

38:32.710 --> 38:33.830
cold and heartless.

38:34.360 --> 38:34.840
You...

38:35.430 --> 38:36.710
Are you playing some kind of

38:36.730 --> 38:38.040
hard-to-get game with me?

38:38.440 --> 38:39.030
Let me tell you,

38:39.280 --> 38:40.440
I won't fall for that trick.

38:46.550 --> 38:48.320
Everything I said was sincere.

38:49.150 --> 38:50.880
My youthful affection was sincere

38:51.390 --> 38:53.190
and the feelings I've held for decades

38:53.210 --> 38:54.050
were also sincere.

38:55.320 --> 38:56.440
It's just that now,

38:56.940 --> 38:58.420
I have no more feelings or desires

38:58.800 --> 38:59.800
for you.

39:00.440 --> 39:01.630
I only hope that you can

39:01.630 --> 39:03.840
let me go, considering my decades

39:05.590 --> 39:06.630
of loyal service.

39:11.760 --> 39:12.800
I only wish

39:13.330 --> 39:14.880
to live the rest of my life

39:16.410 --> 39:18.410
on my own terms.

39:24.550 --> 39:25.510
Fine.

39:27.760 --> 39:29.190
If the Celestial Sect can't keep you,

39:29.840 --> 39:30.960
why should I force you to stay?

39:32.150 --> 39:33.440
If you want to leave, then go quickly.

39:46.670 --> 39:47.320
I...

40:30.150 --> 40:31.000
Master.

40:31.960 --> 40:32.510
Zeng,

40:33.330 --> 40:33.970
there's no need.

40:35.040 --> 40:36.550
You've aged so much more than me.

40:36.680 --> 40:37.760
All this bowing back and forth

40:37.910 --> 40:39.100
might shorten my lifespan.

40:41.190 --> 40:41.960
Then, Master, I...

40:41.980 --> 40:43.460
From now on, just call me Ranran.

40:44.550 --> 40:45.070
Ranran,

40:45.850 --> 40:46.890
as you wish.

40:49.280 --> 40:49.960
Your hand...

40:50.790 --> 40:51.980
You must have suffered back then.

40:54.070 --> 40:55.550
That was so long ago.

40:55.840 --> 40:56.920
It doesn't affect me at all now.

40:57.230 --> 40:58.250
If you want to make weapons

40:58.280 --> 40:59.320
or magical artifacts,

40:59.630 --> 41:00.440
just leave it to me.

41:00.800 --> 41:01.760
Thanks to you all these years

41:01.760 --> 41:02.920
for being with Shui

41:03.400 --> 41:04.960
and taking such good care of Mount Wester.

41:05.180 --> 41:06.390
Shui is used to being alone,

41:06.840 --> 41:07.760
but with you around,

41:08.130 --> 41:09.040
at least he has someone

41:09.070 --> 41:10.070
to consult with.

41:10.480 --> 41:11.150
Back then,

41:11.520 --> 41:12.410
if he hadn't risked his life

41:12.440 --> 41:13.070
to save you,

41:13.510 --> 41:14.000
I wouldn't have

41:14.030 --> 41:15.070
said another word to him.

41:15.920 --> 41:16.710
He always said

41:17.030 --> 41:18.110
that when you regained your memory,

41:18.230 --> 41:19.440
you could punish him however you wanted.

41:20.230 --> 41:20.710
But I knew

41:20.710 --> 41:21.800
you wouldn't blame him at all.

41:24.440 --> 41:25.550
How is he now?

41:26.070 --> 41:27.150
Before I returned to Mount Wester,

41:27.500 --> 41:28.250
Yu Chen and Yu Tong

41:28.280 --> 41:29.230
sent sound transmission talismans

41:30.310 --> 41:31.830
saying that Shui seemed to have completely demonized.

41:32.230 --> 41:33.360
Both Yu Chen and Yu Tong

41:33.490 --> 41:34.410
were also severely injured by the demonic energy,

41:34.440 --> 41:35.400
damaging their Foundations.

41:35.840 --> 41:36.960
I've brought them back

41:37.070 --> 41:38.510
and told them to immediately go into seclusion to recover.

41:38.800 --> 41:40.800
It will take several years of recuperation before they can come out.

41:41.110 --> 41:41.840
During this time,

41:42.030 --> 41:43.110
please take care of them as well.

41:44.590 --> 41:46.230
This Dun Tian really calculated every move.

41:46.710 --> 41:48.280
If Su Yishui has completely become a demon,

41:48.590 --> 41:48.910
then...

41:48.940 --> 41:49.530
I don't believe it.

41:49.960 --> 41:51.250
I will definitely bring him back.

41:53.440 --> 41:54.400
Bring him back.

41:54.920 --> 41:55.590
Oh, Master,

41:56.150 --> 41:57.230
your identity

41:57.630 --> 41:58.880
is now known throughout the Heavenly Sects.

41:59.190 --> 42:00.150
The fellow disciples

42:00.170 --> 42:01.220
realized they mistook their Master.

42:01.590 --> 42:02.890
They're all at the foot of Mount Wester now,

42:02.920 --> 42:04.000
feeling too guilty to come up.

42:04.440 --> 42:05.070
What do you think?

42:05.360 --> 42:06.630
It wasn't their fault to begin with.

42:07.320 --> 42:08.550
But there's no need for them to come back.

42:09.600 --> 42:10.770
Who knows

42:11.160 --> 42:12.080
what kind of bloody storm

42:12.110 --> 42:13.320
Mount Wester may face now?

42:13.710 --> 42:15.070
Why involve them in this?

42:15.960 --> 42:16.800
Time

42:17.760 --> 42:19.070
is probably really running out.

42:22.480 --> 42:23.030
Master,

42:23.280 --> 42:24.000
the demon Su Yishui

42:24.020 --> 42:25.230
has broken into Mount Eternal.

42:26.190 --> 42:26.960
Where is he now?

42:27.270 --> 42:28.280
He went straight to the Jade Pool.

42:28.510 --> 42:29.440
Master has already rushed there.

42:29.900 --> 42:31.010
Use sound transmission talismans to notify Mount Wester.

42:31.630 --> 42:32.360
Open the teleportation array

42:32.510 --> 42:33.550
and have Xue Ranran come over quickly.

42:33.880 --> 42:34.320
Yes.

42:55.030 --> 42:55.760
Demon,

42:56.200 --> 42:58.080
how dare you touch the Eternal Sect's Jade Pool?

43:03.270 --> 43:04.500
So your target

43:04.960 --> 43:06.890
is the Eternal Sect's spiritual channel.

43:09.030 --> 43:10.070
In your dreams!

43:11.320 --> 43:12.080
Activate the formation

43:12.830 --> 43:13.710
to assist Master!

43:25.050 --> 43:25.740
Master!

43:27.960 --> 43:28.880
Immortal, leave it to me.

43:30.880 --> 43:31.630
Su Yishui!

43:33.760 --> 43:35.150
Su Yishui is no longer here.

43:35.380 --> 43:36.000
What?

43:37.520 --> 43:39.040
Are you here to take this shell?
